Doomlike Dungeons
Authors: JaredBGreat (Jared Blackburn), Xiroc
Source: https://github.com/BlackJar72/DoomlikeDungeons
License: MIT (see LICENSE in this folder)

BigCasares contains a Java reimplementation of the Doomlike Dungeons layout
algorithm (room seeds, node routes, room growth, features and theme settings),
adapted to emit structure templates at datapack build time instead of placing
blocks in a live world.
